  m_text: "At the start of the game, your goal is to win at least <color=#FFCC00><b>2</b></color>
    rounds (minimum). \n\nWhen you win, you are given a continue button and other
    buttons. \n\nThe continue button is for going to the next level. \n\nThe next
    levels are more difficult than others and include different visual variants and
    \ndifferent gameplay variants.\n\n\"If you want more info on how different \ngameplay
    mechanics and controls!\"\n\nCheck out <b>Controls Tab</b>!\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
